            "name": "background",
            "path": "C:\\Users\\Oron\\.codex\\generated_images\\01a0e891-2103-7921-88b8-97d572b45fe3\\exec-132b53dd-675b-4765-9298-14e7a58c410e.png",
            "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: production painted clean background for a portrait 4:5 mobile travel puzzle. Paint a berry tart breakfast beside a sunny cottage window, gently elevated three-quarter view. Match a polished warm storybook digital painting: dimensional illustrated objects, tactile softly brushed surfaces, detailed ceramic glaze and crumb textures, gentle upper-left sunlight, rich small discoveries and clear local colors. Dominant warm terracotta #C97A54 on the cottage plaster and large linen tabletop; balanced cream and berry details. No recognizable city landmark, city name, text, signs, logos, UI, frame or watermark. Finished image target 1280x1600. Composition: table occupies lower 65%; window with a softly blurred generic garden occupies upper left. A white ceramic cup of tea sits near x30%, y46%, with its rim at y42%; NO STEAM. A small pot with a naturally complete short bare stem sits upper right near x83%, y34%; do NOT draw its later foreground rosemary sprig. A tiny ivory bud vase with open rim sits near x12%, y77%; NO foreground daisy in this vase. A beautiful berry tart on a scalloped cream plate sits x57%, y62%, with red berries and glazed crust but NO mint garnish. A neatly folded PLAIN ivory napkin rests on the lower right. Keep a natural small terracotta tabletop patch near x40%, y77% available for a later separately painted fallen strawberry leaf. This is a complete attractive clean plate underlying five future painted moving details: steam, rosemary sprig, daisy stem, fallen strawberry leaf, and tiny mint garnish. Paint all surfaces fully, no holes, blank boxes, placeholders or prepainted copies of those five details.",
            "retainedSource": "C:\\GIT\\jigsaw-travel-client\\assets\\art\\ah001-scenes\\ah001-011-food-drink-visibility-v2\\source\\background.png",
