            "prompt": "Create a production transparent PNG sprite atlas, 3 columns \u00c3\u2014 2 rows, five separate hand-painted cutouts and a completely empty bottom-right cell. True transparent alpha background, no shadows cast on an invisible surface, no colored/checkered backdrop, no text/numbers/borders. Every sprite entirely inside its cell with wide transparent gutters. Polished dimensional warm storybook digital painting with soft brush texture, delicate detailed natural surfaces and sunlight from upper left. These are unique details for a terracotta berry-tart breakfast next to a sunny cottage window. Top left: slender gently curling translucent cream tea steam wisp, tapering to a single narrow bottom origin. Top middle: graceful small rosemary sprig with fine needle leaves, one slender brown stem at the bottom, a slight natural rightward bend. Top right: one tiny white daisy flower on a long thin green stem with two little leaves, bottom stem exposed for insertion into a vase. Bottom left: one natural strawberry leaf lying flat, seen from a gently elevated three-quarter angle, muted olive green with serrated edge, small ochre stem, no soil. Bottom middle: a tiny fresh mint garnish with three overlapping richly textured green leaves, resting flat on a berry tart, gently elevated three-quarter view, no plate or tart. Bottom right: completely empty transparent. Do not include any extra subjects, dishes, vases, pots, furniture or opaque backgrounds. Five distinct art elements, no reuse.",
